  *
- * Recovery while down, on l_ethernet: GT not out of reset (GTWIZ reset done
- * low, e.g. the refclk started late) -> reset-all; no signal at all (no
- * block lock on any lane: dark fiber, module off) -> GT RX datapath reset
- * only, every HSE_LINK_NOSIG_RETRY_MS after the first attempts, never a
- * reset-all (restarting our TX would push the partner's healthy RX through
- * a re-alignment, into the error state above); signal present but RX not
- * working -> RX datapath reset, and a reset-all only after
- * HSE_RX_ONLY_RESETS such attempts failed. CMAC: reset-all (the only GT
- * reset its register map has).
+ * The first of the two reads covers the whole interval since the previous
+ * sample: an outage that heals between two healthy samples is still
+ * counted (hse_rx_unaligned_events) and logged. Recovery while down: see
